# Claude Code ignore patterns
# Prevents agents from reading files that bloat context

# Node modules and package files
**/node_modules/
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Build artifacts
**/build/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/.next/
**/.nuxt/
**/.output/

**/*.log
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# Documentation website (large generated files)
docs/website/node_modules/
docs/website/build/
docs/website/.docusaurus/
docs/website/package-lock.json

# IDE and editor files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo

# OS files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Large binary files
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.pdf
**/*.zip
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.bin

# Coverage reports
**/coverage/
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov/
